{"headword":"יְגִיעַ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m. toil, product</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:42\" href=\"/Genesis.31.42\">Gn 31:42</a> + 5 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעֲךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:33\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.33\">Dt 28:33</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:11\" href=\"/Job.39.11\">Jb 39:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.29\">Ez 23:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:11\" href=\"/Psalms.109.11\">ψ 109:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.13\">Ne 5:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:16\" href=\"/Job.39.16\">Jb 39:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.5\">Je 20:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וִיגִיעֲכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.2\">Is 55:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וִיגִיעָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:46\" href=\"/Psalms.78.46\">ψ 78:46</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:9\" href=\"/Hosea.12.9\">Ho 12:9</a> (but <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעָיו</span> 𝔊 Che);—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>toil</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יג׳ כַּפַּיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:42\" href=\"/Genesis.31.42\">Gn 31:42</a> (E; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֳנִי</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 39:11\" href=\"/Job.39.11\">Jb 39:11</a> (= husbandry), laying of eggs <a data-ref=\"Job 39:16\" href=\"/Job.39.16\">39:16</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"result of toil, <em>product, produce, acquired property:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:9\" href=\"/Hosea.12.9\">Ho 12:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹן</span>, on text v. supr.), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:33\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.33\">Dt 28:33</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרִי אדמתך</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:46\" href=\"/Psalms.78.46\">ψ 78:46</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבוּל</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגִיעַ כַּפַּיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 128:2\" href=\"/Psalms.128.2\">128:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:11\" href=\"/Haggai.1.11\">Hg 1:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּגָן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּירוֹשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִצְהָר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשֶׁר תּוֹצִיא הָאֲדָמָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדָם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהֵמָה</span>); <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.13\">Ne 5:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בית</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:11\" href=\"/Psalms.109.11\">ψ 109:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כל־אשׁר־לוֹ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.14\">Is 45:14</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">יגיע מצרים</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">סַחַר־כּוּשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.2\">55:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּסֶף</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.24\">Je 3:24</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּקָר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנוֹת</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.5\">20:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹסֶן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יָקָר</span>, of city), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.29\">Ez 23:29</a>; of Job as product of God’s hands <span dir=\"rtl\">(יְג׳ כַּפֶּיךָ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 10:3\" href=\"/Job.10.3\">Jb 10:3</a>."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB03811","strong_numbers":["3018"],"next_hw":"יָגֹר","prev_hw":"יָגִיעַ","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","quotes":[],"GK":["3330"],"TWOT":["842e"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en